      "text": "The blind is already posted, so you often get a better price to continue."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.75,
      "end": 10.5,
      "text": "But defending the blind is not pride, and it is not permission to play everything."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.5,
      "end": 16.25,
      "text": "Good defense balances three things: price, position, and playability."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.25,
      "end": 21.583333333333332,
      "text": "Jack-ten suited can make straights, flushes, and strong pair-plus-draw hands."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.583333333333332,
      "end": 26.875,
      "text": "It realizes equity much better than a dominated offsuit hand like king-four."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.875,
